         trivia = "Level created on February 27, 2026\nUpdates:\nMarch 8, 2026 - Added bounds, replaced trap gravity modifier with slanted platform, and added cheese barriers to ending obstacle.\nSeptember 23, 2026 - Converted help bubbles into help triggers and added camera path, icon picture, challenge times, hints, and trivia.\nTrivia:\nThis sort of area of my first three levels in 2026 (all in February) also marks the beginning of my making higher quality levels in general. Some of these more recent levels turned out very well. In the case of this level, it is a lengthy skill course focused around one topic (I made another one later). Fun fact: some of the obstacles in this level were indirectly inspired when I played the levels from Marble Blast Nostalgia uploaded to Marbleland.";
